{"about_the_game":"Explore a vast procedurally generated world in this survival sandbox adventure for 1-8 players. Gather resources, build shelters, tend your farm, recruit NPC's, craft items or take on high risk dungeon crawling as you delve into the unknown. Be warned: Only the most courageous hero can uncover the secrets to Delverium. Could this be you?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT AND BUILD</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/ed5468d00fc58b44112769fb2c3d4375.poster.avif?t=1771827716\" width=780 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/ed5468d00fc58b44112769fb2c3d4375.webm?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/ed5468d00fc58b44112769fb2c3d4375.mp4?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Unlock and craft a huge array of items including food, tools, weapons, armor and building materials. Build shelters for safety and recruit NPC's who provide valuable trading options. Enjoy many quality of life features like nested crafting and an expandable player inventory.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEND YOUR FARM</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/2c8d313b50ff00e9ecf9576f6cc71d53.poster.avif?t=1771827716\" width=780 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/2c8d313b50ff00e9ecf9576f6cc71d53.webm?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/2c8d313b50ff00e9ecf9576f6cc71d53.mp4?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Till the soil, plant seeds, water your crops and watch your farm grow. Breed animals, catch fish and gather wild ingredients to combine with your harvest in a wide range of cooking recipes to eat and trade.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DELVE DEEP</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/a5fda2579b21a5057a87ef2bbb5eebc7.poster.avif?t=1771827716\" width=780 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/a5fda2579b21a5057a87ef2bbb5eebc7.webm?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/a5fda2579b21a5057a87ef2bbb5eebc7.mp4?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Discover exotic biomes, hidden caves and dangerous dungeons that abound the land. Explore far and wide to mine ores, collect rare materials, unearth lost treasures, defeat foes and loot unique items.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE HIDDEN TRUTH</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/6a9798d1e3defdd77c845aba70f76b3a.poster.avif?t=1771827716\" width=780 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/6a9798d1e3defdd77c845aba70f76b3a.webm?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/6a9798d1e3defdd77c845aba70f76b3a.mp4?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>There is a great peril infecting the land and you are the only hero who can restore stability. Uncover lost fragments of lore and hunt down the 'Faults' to piece together the hidden truth of Delverium.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/0e66054553cd112b3ef1f7df3a966d5b.poster.avif?t=1771827716\" width=780 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/0e66054553cd112b3ef1f7df3a966d5b.webm?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/0e66054553cd112b3ef1f7df3a966d5b.mp4?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Be it casual farming, settlement building, exploring the unknown or delving into dangerous dungeons; Play how you like and enjoy Delverium either solo, 4-player split screen or up to 8-player online co-op with Steam friends.<br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2710040?t=1771827716","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2710040?t=1771827716","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/dbc96623bbd53a057f23a7b55ff29b71cd9a1a21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771827716","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/dbc96623bbd53a057f23a7b55ff29b71cd9a1a21/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771827716","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3426800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/c93f5da647248591e59d578d0666c782.avif?t=1771827716\" width=780 height=100 /></span><br>Join the Official Delverium Community to read the latest news, participate in discussions and be notified of any upcoming Delverium playtests! Click the Discord link in the details panel to join up!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Explore a vast procedurally generated world in this survival sandbox adventure for 1-8 players. Gather resources, build shelters, tend your farm, recruit NPC's, craft items or take on high risk dungeon crawling as you delve into the unknown. Be warned: Only the most courageous hero can uncover the secrets to Delverium. Could this be you?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT AND BUILD</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/ed5468d00fc58b44112769fb2c3d4375.poster.avif?t=1771827716\" width=780 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/ed5468d00fc58b44112769fb2c3d4375.webm?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/ed5468d00fc58b44112769fb2c3d4375.mp4?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Unlock and craft a huge array of items including food, tools, weapons, armor and building materials. Build shelters for safety and recruit NPC's who provide valuable trading options. Enjoy many quality of life features like nested crafting and an expandable player inventory.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEND YOUR FARM</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/2c8d313b50ff00e9ecf9576f6cc71d53.poster.avif?t=1771827716\" width=780 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/2c8d313b50ff00e9ecf9576f6cc71d53.webm?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/2c8d313b50ff00e9ecf9576f6cc71d53.mp4?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Till the soil, plant seeds, water your crops and watch your farm grow. Breed animals, catch fish and gather wild ingredients to combine with your harvest in a wide range of cooking recipes to eat and trade.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DELVE DEEP</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/a5fda2579b21a5057a87ef2bbb5eebc7.poster.avif?t=1771827716\" width=780 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/a5fda2579b21a5057a87ef2bbb5eebc7.webm?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/a5fda2579b21a5057a87ef2bbb5eebc7.mp4?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Discover exotic biomes, hidden caves and dangerous dungeons that abound the land. Explore far and wide to mine ores, collect rare materials, unearth lost treasures, defeat foes and loot unique items.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE HIDDEN TRUTH</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/6a9798d1e3defdd77c845aba70f76b3a.poster.avif?t=1771827716\" width=780 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/6a9798d1e3defdd77c845aba70f76b3a.webm?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/6a9798d1e3defdd77c845aba70f76b3a.mp4?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>There is a great peril infecting the land and you are the only hero who can restore stability. Uncover lost fragments of lore and hunt down the 'Faults' to piece together the hidden truth of Delverium.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/0e66054553cd112b3ef1f7df3a966d5b.poster.avif?t=1771827716\" width=780 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/0e66054553cd112b3ef1f7df3a966d5b.webm?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/extras/0e66054553cd112b3ef1f7df3a966d5b.mp4?t=1771827716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Be it casual farming, settlement building, exploring the unknown or delving into dangerous dungeons; Play how you like and enjoy Delverium either solo, 4-player split screen or up to 8-player online co-op with Steam friends.<br>","developers":["Sagestone Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710040/80350ab3b5c64bfbb462ab058415c0cac7f9f19f/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1771827716","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended